# Variadic function with both named and variadic params.
# The non-variadic param binds normally; the variadic rest collects remaining args as Dict.
# The type checker infers the named param type from usage and assigns Seq(T) to the variadic.
[f: [fn [let x ...rest] [+ x 0]]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, rest), "result": Int(10)})
